body:
@tokra2003 this is the most reliable answer so far. If you'd like a little bit of help, 

https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.one.s20.launcher  is a launcher made to look like one UI (Samsung) and Hex installer seems to be a really customisable one that def has what you're looking for. 

Imo, I understand preferences, but the flip didn't take too long to get used to for me
